{% comment %}
=================================================================================
CREATOR DASHBOARD PAGE TEMPLATE
=================================================================================
Displays the creator dashboard for logged-in users
Access: /pages/creator-dashboard
=================================================================================
{% endcomment %}

<div class="creator-dashboard-page">

  {% comment %}
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  CREATOR STATS DASHBOARD — Financial overview (always visible)
  Shows: Total Earnings | Designs Sold | Tier Badge | Progress Bar
  Auto-refreshes every 60s. Fetches from /api/creator/earnings.
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  {% endcomment %}
  {%- if customer -%}
  <div class="creator-stats-wrapper">
    {% section 'creator-stats-dashboard' %}
  </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {% section 'creator-dashboard-enhanced' %}
</div>

{% comment %}
=================================================================================
CREATOR LISTING DASHBOARD — Design-to-Earn Pipeline
=================================================================================
Renders the listing UI when a creator has a design ready to publish.
Pass ?design_id=<uuid> as a URL param — the section reads it via Liquid.
Access: /pages/creator-dashboard?design_id=<uuid>
=================================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{%- comment -%}
Shopify exposes query params via request.query_parameters (newer) or via the
raw URL. Both lookups are included so legacy and current runtimes both work.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign design_id_param = request.query_parameters.design_id | default: request.parameters.design_id -%}
{%- if design_id_param == blank -%}
  {%- assign raw_url = request.url | default: '' -%}
  {%- if raw_url contains 'design_id=' -%}
    {%- assign _parts = raw_url | split: 'design_id=' -%}
    {%- assign design_id_param = _parts[1] | split: '&' | first | split: '#' | first -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if design_id_param != blank -%}
<div class="creator-listing-section-wrapper" data-design-id="{{ design_id_param | escape }}">
  {% section 'creator-listing-dashboard' %}
</div>
{%- endif -%}